# Verkada

> Verkada is an enterprise physical security company offering cloud-managed
> cameras, access control, sensors, alarms, and visitor management - all
> unified on the Verkada Command platform.

Verkada provides enterprise-grade physical security hardware tightly
integrated with a cloud-based software platform. Products are managed
through a single pane of glass (Verkada Command) without on-premise servers.

## Products

- [Verkada Command](https://www.verkada.com/command/): Unified cloud management platform for all Verkada devices
- [Connectivity](https://www.verkada.com/connectivity/): Deploy Verkada devices in remote locations with cellular, Wi-Fi, or Ethernet connectivity
- [Video Security](https://www.verkada.com/security-cameras/): Cloud-managed security cameras with on-board storage and AI analytics
- [Access Control](https://www.verkada.com/access-control/): Door controllers, readers, and cloud-based credential management
- [Environmental Sensors](https://www.verkada.com/sensors/): Air quality, temperature, humidity, and motion sensors
- [Alarms](https://www.verkada.com/alarms/): Intrusion detection and deterrence systems with professional monitoring
- [Intercom](https://www.verkada.com/intercom/): Video intercom with remote unlock capability
- [Guest Management](https://www.verkada.com/guest/): Digital visitor sign-in and badge printing
- [Mailroom Management](https://www.verkada.com/mailroom/): Package tracking and pickup notifications
- [Viewing Station](https://www.verkada.com/viewing-station/): Dedicated hardware for live and recorded video review


